  "description": "As star ballerino, Jean Ivandish endures every cruelty just to keep dancing. But when Lev Volkoprin, a mesmerizing bourgeois star rising in high society, enters his world, everything changes. Lev’s gentle warmth and alluring gaze break through Jean’s defenses, daring him to dream of a life he truly wants. Yet beneath the glittering spotlight, dangerous secrets linger…and the truth always strikes when you least expect it. Can Jin trust this newfound passion before it destroys him?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
